      "comment": "FRIES WITH THAT (5) is the one to beat on consistency, having won a 3yo+ Benchmark 56+ at Carnarvon over 1600m before being beaten just over half a length there over 1750m as the well-supported favourite. The rise to 2000m is the question, but he is racing too well to ignore. HARD QUESTIONS (1) brings the strongest class reference after missing by a neck in a 3yo+ Open at Carnarvon, and the drop from that level gives him a serious winning case despite the distance query. CANDLELIGHT SHERIF (4) was wide throughout when fifth behind Pharoah Show, yet his Junction win from Tiff's Lad keeps him in the mix for the minors. MYSTICAL MAN (3) looks a big improver back in this grade.",
